    "probability_feedback": "Deterministic. SupportPolicy type takes strict-past full losses, points through current point and current loss; actual output_t constructed before current update. Fixed policy ignores history/current loss and returns g_t; legality proved along generated path. No claim of history sensitivity or stronger oracle restriction.",
